            "id": 89780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, language)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.language = language\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>self</code> deve essere il primo parametro del metodo <code>__init__</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nel codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non ci servono le parole chiave <code>self</code> davanti a <code>name</code> e <code>language</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>self</code> deve essere il primo parametro del metodo <code>__init__</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
