            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi le variabili <code>name</code>, <code>number</code> e <code>withdraw</code> al costruttore della classe e impostale sui parametri corrispondenti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bank_Account\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, number, withdraw)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.number = number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.withdraw = withdraw\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.balance = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>self</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>withdraw</code>.</p></body></html>"
